    {
      "id": "how-to-contribute",
      "type": "bodyText",
      "data": {
        "title": "How to Contribute",
        "paragraphs": [
          "There are many ways you can contribute to the Pet Food Pantry and help local animals in need, including donating supplies or providing monetary support. Items can be purchased to donate from Pet Supplies Plus and deposited at the Bethel Park store.",
          "If you have questions, would like to learn how you can get involved or need assistance for your animal, please contact us at 412-928-9777 or animaladvocatespgh294@gmail.com"
        ],
